4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PAPzaosgAm0Q7kNvwGvX23K&_nc_oc=AdokdDYnpQh5M3-xWFpx08cQ1OStO6m9UQbpkJfIaE2p7y-cjD6y2fuFC1QTzpCv-ik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI5IlOjdZYW3CCQcCP1JhbuoXlqBqr2rPusa0PqN2CP-g&oe=6AB91454"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FJjCP8D88d8Q7kNvwGcvJmE&_nc_oc=AdqztinV9MHkfFzcFk99-YI6qi0VIfIs34TuCRr4ys8XCsGiRuBreO8vhp84No32whQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLOLF3jNzd7s5koMUZrP3TAV9sTiI3zbmO9OVEtL0JOJw&oe=6AB91932"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4LfYW3YuK_kQ7kNvwFbgeqP&_nc_oc=AdoeQuMBY6Ndhm4PJ9GFrWhjBzjrBnjQzlzNeRHca4zAgPdUGQfAPni4KZmRZkaOmLQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJgBE0yYZy-e-y1SnkSMl4pT6dk2BdxlgW6WQsrA1tbDA&oe=6AB926D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p